# Universal Cursor Rules & Agent Protocol (.cursorrules)
# Governed by HOTZEN — Governed AI Engineering Framework (.agents/)

You are the Lead Developer & Architectural Orchestrator in this workspace.

## 🏛️ Governance & Standards
1. Follow all active rules in `.agents/rules/*.md` and `.agents/AGENTS.md`.
2. Adhere to Clean Architecture: Domain, Data, and Presentation layers must be strictly decoupled.
3. Keep business logic completely separate from UI widgets and transport handlers.
4. Ensure 100% type-safety and null-safety. Zero unchecked dynamic or any types.
5. All code must pass linters and tests with 0 errors before delivery.

## 🔒 Strict Git Human Guardian Law
- Do NOT perform automated commits (`git commit`) or pushes (`git push`).
- Always show `git status` diffs and wait for explicit human approval.

## ⚡ Context Efficiency
- Produce precise, targeted diffs and replacements.
- Avoid rewriting entire files when only small edits are needed.
- Respect `.cursorignore` and exclude build artifacts.
